# GoldenEye Coop: the port's own text in Spanish (lang/README.md)
#
# Each msgid is the English exactly as the game draws it, without its last
# line break; msgstr is the Spanish. The game's own text (missions, briefings,
# the watch) comes from the translation patch, not from here, and this file
# follows its words: Presa, Agente secreto, Mirilla, Autoapuntado, Salud,
# Escenario, Nivel. A string that is only ever drawn in capitals still needs
# just one entry: the game capitalises the Spanish itself (and drops the
# accents in capitals, as the patch does).
#
# Keep every %d / %s in the same order. A line the game wraps can be long; a
# menu label has to fit beside its value, so keep those short.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: es\n"

